; Starter dark fantasy palette, 16 colors. One RRGGBB per line.
; Replace it with your game's palette (Lospec.com "HEX file" downloads work as-is,
; and so do Aseprite .gpl files: point `palette:` in assets.yaml at either).
; Optional: a name after a color ("0d0b12 k"). One-character names are drawing keys
; for text sprites, so art/<id>.yaml files can use them without a keys block.
0d0b12 k
1f1a2b x
3a2f4a u
5e4b6b U
8f7a99 l
c9bcd1 w
2b1d14 c
5a3a22 C
9a6a3a o
d9a066 O
4a0f12 R
8f1d21 r
d94a38 e
2e3b2a n
5b7a3d N
e8d9a8 y
